    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>首先告诉大家一声，我们的礼盒款香薰：</span></p><span></span><p><span>SINCE BEAUTY如月千早系列香薰（梨雨兰吟/栀子花开）</span></p><span></span><p><span>现已售罄！</span></p><span></span><p><span>新品准备中，期待一下吧~</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期你将会听到，Joy在春节期间画画的分享~</span></p><span></span><p><span>shownotes底部有我和我妈妈的画作别划走哦~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="121">00:02:01</a>:创意手作：数字油画绘画之旅，送礼更贴心！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="242">00:04:02</a>:轻松绘画数字油画，体验内心平静与创作乐趣！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="365">00:06:05</a>:体验数字油画的魅力：轻松绘画出美丽的数字画作品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="487">00:08:07</a>:绘画小贴士：如何避免颜料干燥问题及调色技巧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="608">00:10:08</a>:绘画技巧分享：如何处理丙烯颜料干透的问题？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="729">00:12:09</a>:随心所欲的油画创作：颜色涂画技巧与建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="849">00:14:09</a>:家庭涂鸦，亲子共画：谁说年龄不能成为绘画的障碍？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="972">00:16:12</a>:绘画中的心流体验：定制数字油画的过程与结果</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1095">00:18:15</a>:春节绘画体验：创作自己的作品并赋予祝福的意义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1217">00:20:17</a>:DIY数字油画：春节体验绘画的乐趣与发现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1337">00:22:17</a>:分享邂逅故事：新款香薰等你来</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhWCMWpmzw3El410SC95qYfTIgvN.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>↑送朋友们的事事如意画作，每幅画差不多是2个白天的工时。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmoo1a5ufdVYb2a8Cpe7UCgfzKGd.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>↑春节在家边看剧边画的风景画</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqCFvMv1oTkCWifsii1zAjJrP9Ii.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>↑JOY妈妈在画的风景画（半成品，快完成了）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fuq7_XhzEaD_5KUbxM3oz0aPYCEK.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>↑JOY妈妈画的妞妞~</span></p>]]></description>
