  <item>
    <title>话香21 原来手工扭扭棒可以扩香？-文不对题的分享手工的快乐</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65a0f4a96d045a7f5ee03035</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65a0f4a96d045a7f5ee03035</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 12 Jan 2024 08:13:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>&gt;本集概要&lt;</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是一期Joy和Vivan利用午休的半小时录制的一集分享手工制作的快乐。</span></p><span></span><p><span>&gt;用香小Tips&lt;</span></p><span></span><p><span>将喜欢的香味喷洒在扭扭棒花束上哦，也是不错的扩香方式呢。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Vivan的同款手作即将上架~</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎关注节目小红书→</span><strong><span>闲来话香</span></strong><span>，随缘上新呢。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你将听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="31">00:31</a> 那些年Vivan做过的手工。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="77">01:17</a> 手工达人Vivan向我们介绍了她做的扭扭棒花束、和妈妈一起完成的金翅鸟冠等手工作品。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="141">02:21</a> 做扭扭棒手工是因为想作为一份特别的圣诞礼物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="200">03:20</a> 扭扭棒是什么？新手小白可以用扭扭棒做出什么样的作品呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="551">09:11</a> 想挑战一下，扬州非遗绒花的制作。</span></p><span></span><p><span>&gt;嘉宾介绍&lt;</span></p><span></span><p><span>Vivan 初入职场打工人，平时爱好追剧、看电影、听音乐和做手工。从小就有一双灵巧的手。</span></p><span></span><p><span>&gt;本期主播&lt;</span></p><span></span><p><span>Joy &nbsp;播客《闲来话香》主理人</span></p><span></span><p><span>美妆&amp;健康食品民工</span></p><span></span><p><span>有氧划水大家、Crossfit爱好者</span></p><span></span><p><span>即刻@放开那个小Joy</span></p><span></span><p><span>&gt;节目介绍&lt;</span></p><span></span><p><span>闲来话香，用声音共创香氛生活。不定时更新，与身边人聊聊一些泛生活话题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>彩蛋1 Vivan和妈妈一起制作的金翅鸟冠：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljUE7-mGfmlfkumW7roSCtzukdQb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>彩蛋2 Vivan制作的扭扭棒作品</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmjFU5sbezOx22V1hxDi-WvGE1Ad.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>彩蛋3 节目尾声提到的绒花（图片选自网络）</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqD7-SVH_NTDTJ6koMCGZvxFnWhO.png"></p>]]></description>
